    "innovation": "This commentary proposes a large-scale distributed computing initiative, similar to SETI@home, using volunteers' home PCs to run massive climate model ensembles for a more comprehensive, probabilistic assessment of future climate uncertainty.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
